# route: level=w2_l1_coop difficulty=expert players=2 ends=exit after=tally expect=wipes:0,eggs:0,x2_gates:2,min_checkpoints:4,min_kills:14,max_hurts:1
# w2_l1_coop "Echo Caverns" for two - Expert two-stream route proof (designer DB1, wf10; ticks:P1|P2, keys L R U D F K S;
# recorded from closed-loop duo bots, build/db1/p5/bot_w2_l1.gd --rex34_charge --rex_crawl=3100 --rex_stand=3140). Echo Gallery: P1 opens the inset spot;
# P1 jumps over the plateau's Shellback and clubs the plain turtle beyond it, then P2 jumps over the Shellback;
# P1 clubs the bat on its thread. Gate 'hatches': P2 crouches on plate pa (Down held: a held key is input on every
# tick) - the first trapdoor rises and P1 drops into the first chamber, clubs the lurker and crouches on plate pb - the
# second trapdoor rises and P2 drops in. Down the crouch hatches (P1 first), over the Shellbacks of the big and the
# fourth chamber, the lurker, a crawl under the pendulum bat. Gate 'den': P1 hops over each keeper Shellback and
# stands behind it as the bait, P2 clubs its back; their door rises. The Dark Deep: both club each leech as it
# comes, the pools jumped one after the other, crawls under the two pendulum bats, the shore's bat. The Echo Shaft:
# ledge by ledge (P2 a hop behind), both onto the stone lift on the same tick, the zigzag to the top (the loner stinger there: the two
# hop side by side, the same keys on the same tick); over the
# last Shellback, then P1 crawls the last steps to the little rex (Down + Right charges the club) and fells it with
# one charged blow (its hp 25 takes two plain strikes since G57); both into the exit totem. A waiting hero taps Down
# now and then (no role is idle 243 ticks). Club only, no S.
